  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:52:35-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:52:38-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Kevin. My name is Anthony Pellegrino. I'm calling about my trash bin. It was... damaged. Damaged by the truck this morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:52:46-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, damaged by the truck. Let me grab that down. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:52:51-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "381 Spring Street. In the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:52:54-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three eighty-one Spring. And what happened to the bin, exactly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:52:58-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The lid is [pause] cracked, and one wheel is gone. Gone. It was sitting at the curb, nowhere near the road, and the arm must have crushed the side of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:53:09-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that happens. Probably the wet ground from the rain Saturday didn't help either. So you'd like a replacement bin, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:53:17-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd like a supervisor to call me back. A supervisor. I want to talk to somebody about how it gets handled."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:53:25-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. I'll put that in. Is this the best number, or do you want to give me another?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:53:32-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0155. That's my landline. I should say, I run a small cleaning business, and I'm between two houses right now, so the landline is the steadiest number. Steadiest."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:53:42-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-five. Best time to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:53:46-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Afternoons are fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:53:48-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. I'll note afternoons, damaged bin, supervisor call back. Somebody should be in touch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:53:54-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:53:56-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You bet. Take care."
    }
  ],
